{"id":"68985f66fd4c8a5f","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-lem-continuity.md","title":"Continuity Lemma","display":"lem-continuity — Continuity Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-continuity","aliases":["58-lem-continuity"],"display":"lem-continuity — Continuity Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-normalfunction.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-continuity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-continuity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-continuity — Continuity Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8f8c5722fd8d964f\" href=\"?note=8f8c5722fd8d964f\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-normalfunction.md\">../batch04/58-df-normalfunction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> (definable class graph on the ordinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda,\\eta\">\\(\\lambda,\\eta\\)</span> (limit ordinal and its image, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal},\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal},\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (upstream normal-function predicate, limit-ordinal predicate, and ordinal class)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}continuity} \\vdash \\mathrm{Normal}(F)\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\langle\\lambda,\\eta\\rangle\\in F\\to \\eta=\\bigcup\\{\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\exists\\xi\\in\\lambda\\;(\\langle\\xi,\\gamma\\rangle\\in F)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}continuity} \\vdash \\mathrm{Normal}(F)\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\langle\\lambda,\\eta\\rangle\\in F\\to \\eta=\\bigcup\\{\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\exists\\xi\\in\\lambda\\;(\\langle\\xi,\\gamma\\rangle\\in F)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Normal functions are continuous at limit ordinals.</li>\n<li>This is the continuity clause of the upstream class-graph definition.  Function application and a class-indexed union are replaced by graph membership and a set-indexed collection of earlier values.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-normalfunction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8f8c5722fd8d964f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-normalfunction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\lambda,\\eta$ (limit ordinal and its image, see [[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda,\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal},\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}continuity} \\vdash \\mathrm{Normal}(F)\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\langle\\lambda,\\eta\\rangle\\in F\\to \\eta=\\bigcup\\{\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\exists\\xi\\in\\lambda\\;(\\langle\\xi,\\gamma\\rangle\\in F)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1127,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3885","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-lem-continuity.md|58-lem-continuity]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["8f8c5722fd8d964f","81cabbac7fa4d75d"]}